00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:06.820
All stations, clear the air lanes, clear all air lanes for the big broadcasts.

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:13.910
Yes, we're tuning up this week for some dramatic operatic pandemonium in one of the most famous

00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:15.270
opera house horror legends.

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:20.060
It's the classic story of a composer-violinist who is infatuated with a beautiful young singer

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:22.600
and anonymously tries to forward her career.

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:24.580
Is he great or what?

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:29.160
Well, his own career starts to fall apart, and when he confronts an unethical music publisher,

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:30.000
he snaps and...

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.210
kills him, only to be splashed with acid during the act.

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:38.110
Soon his favorite protégé is caught in the middle when mysterious threats to those who

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:42.230
might hold her career back result in fiendish murders, and the opera house is plagued by

00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:46.730
a mysterious phantom who manages to elude capture while trying to finally keep the young

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:51.660
singer all to himself in the legendary tale of the Phantom of the Opera.

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:53.660
Enough with the singing already.

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:55.000
Yes, you will get sick of it.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:00.000
This version of the story also includes a lot of the familiar features of the popular novel by Gaston

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.100
and features former Invisible Man Claude Rains as the Phantom,

00:02:04.480 --> 00:02:08.000
along with famed musical star Nelson Eddy as the opera's leading man.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:12.180
Now, this movie was actually shot on the exact same Opera House soundstage

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:15.040
on the Universal lot where the famous silent version

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:17.340
starring Lon Chaney Sr. as the Phantom was filmed.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:19.060
Oh, simply wonderful!

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:22.760
